 "hook": {
  "text": "THEY BUILT IT ON\nA LOST CITY",
  "until": 2.9,
  "y": 0.13,
  "size": 118,
  "accent": [
   "LOST",
   "CITY"
  ]
 },
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In the 1800s, the British built a railway... with bricks from a lost civilisation.",
   "emph": [
    "railway...",
    "lost"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "They were laying a line from Lahore to Multan, and they needed broken brick to hold the tracks.",
   "emph": [
    "lahore",
    "multan,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Near a village called Harappa, they found mounds full of it.",
   "emph": [
    "harappa,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Red. Fired. Perfectly shaped bricks.",
   "emph": [
    "perfectly"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "So they smashed them. Enough, an archaeologist later wrote, for about a hundred miles of track.",
   "caption": "So they smashed them. Enough, an archaeologist later wrote, for about 100 miles of track.",
   "emph": [
    "smashed",
    "100"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "In that same mound, he found something tiny.",
   "emph": [
    "tiny."
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "A stone seal. A bull... and six signs no one could read.",
   "caption": "A stone seal. A bull... and 6 signs no one could read.",
   "emph": [
    "seal.",
    "6"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "He decided it must have come from somewhere else... and moved on.",
   "emph": [
    "moved"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Nineteen twenty-four. The ruins are finally announced to the world. But no one knows how old they are.",
   "caption": "1924. The ruins are finally announced to the world. But no one knows how old they are.",
   "emph": [
    "1924.",
    "old"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "One week later, a professor writes in. These seals match finds from ancient Persia and Mesopotamia.",
   "emph": [
    "week",
    "persia",
    "mesopotamia."
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Over four thousand years old.",
   "caption": "Over 4,000 years old.",
   "emph": [
    "4,000"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "In one week, India's known history went back two thousand years.",
   "caption": "In one week, India's known history went back 2,000 years.",
   "emph": [
    "2,000"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "That bull was never foreign. It belonged to a civilisation as old as the pyramids...",
   "emph": [
    "never",
    "pyramids..."
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The Indus Valley Civilisation."
  }
 ],
